  "changes": [
    "Restored the original 24 brand color tokens, including navy background and original blue accent, dim and light variants. Hex case is normalized by the formatter; numeric values are unchanged.",
    "Restored the original studio-cojauny-white.svg logo in header/footer; original Cojauny and FC Español assets identify projects. Removed the invented StudioWordmark, route illustration and playing-card artwork. Cuatro Sotas retains its existing project title without a new mark.",
    "Restored original icon assets for links and visible original locale flags. Preserved the panoramic hero, project index, service register, responsive menu and all existing destinations/statuses.",
    "Button contrast uses original navy text on the original blue accent; hover uses original light text on original dim blue. Contact sheet uses original navy so existing error labels keep contrast.",
    "Consent store, analytics beforeSend, banner hidden behavior, contact component/API, and privacy fixes are unchanged from the approved local implementation."
